AI Security Gateway (Firewall) & Container Sandbox
Implementation, Deployment, and Operations Manual
This document provides complete instructions for setting up, running, auditing, and troubleshooting your production-hardened AI Security Gateway.
1. System Architecture Overview
The system operates as an Inline Reverse Proxy sitting between untrusted clients/data feeds and your downstream Large Language Model or database orchestrators.

                  [ UNTRUSTED PAYLOAD ]
                            │
                            ▼
              ┌───────────────────────────┐
              │ 1. Network Edge (mTLS)    │  <-- drops connection if unsigned
              └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
              ┌───────────────────────────┐
              │ 2. Rate Limiting (Redis)  │  <-- thwats DDoS & token flooding
              └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
              ┌───────────────────────────┐
              │ 3. Entrypoint Gate        │  <-- Heuristics & Llama Guard (Taxonomy)
              └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                            │
                            ▼
              ┌───────────────────────────┐
              │ 4. Worker Sandbox Engine  │  <-- Unprivileged MicroVM Docker
              └───────────────────────────┘


